### POST request to record a payment
POST http://localhost:8000/api/billing/payments
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "hospitalId": "11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111",
  "patientId": "123e4567-e89b-12d3-a456-426614174000",
  "invoiceId": "{{invoiceId}}",
  "amount": 700,
  "paymentMethod": "UPI",
  "status": "SUCCESS",
  "transactionReference": "UPI-TEST-001"
}
